cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it as below, and credit the upstream sources listed in docs/DATA.md."
type: software
title: "LLM Market Observatory"
abstract: >-
  A governed, tested history of first-party LLM API list prices, rebuilt day by day from
  the git history of LiteLLM's public price file since 2023-09-06, with a labelled
  Kaplan-Meier measurement of recorded price cuts, a pre-registered validation against
  Epoch AI, and a descriptive SDK-adoption view.
authors:
  - given-names: Sanjay
    family-names: M
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sanjaayyy7/llm-market-observatory"
url: "https://sanjaayyy7.github.io/llm-market-observatory/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - llm
  - api pricing
  - dbt
  - duckdb
  - survival analysis
  - open data
